# November 22, 2026: Chattanooga, Tennessee: the buildings named in one video walk-through of the city's old
# architecture, checked one by one. The video was a list of names only; every fact here comes from the linked
# sources, read when this batch was written: National Register nomination forms (NPGallery text layers), the
# 2020 Downtown Chattanooga Historic District form, Wikipedia, HMdb markers, the National Park Service and the
# places' own pages. Chattanooga keeps Eastern time. Where sources disagree the text gives both.
